  "id": "c8d9ec6305ec626294a79cfe",
  "title": "忍者神龟3",
  "summary": "童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。 这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写《激龟忍者传》时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。 这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。 故事放到我身上，是加了料的： 话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3974e88e86cadf13247b0e79eb4f23a01b9da2bb04bc70bc5a82d67d8618e15094c72b53b16a5f0ddfc1e813aeddecc2a8b14e476636344c9b1417938d66e7b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3：曼哈顿计划</a></p>\n<p>童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。<br>\n这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6186f29e36b3a692a6426420bd8a420f08ae4b43c377d7e7101b31a0b3e4fe654c3678db7c81961787c326edbe256ce6856e61438e093f3b8d87e18afe7097eede6282966841\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《激龟忍者传》</a>时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a4d77a7585148685e3bd8173586eb94f48eb3912aedb85cc5325d549ddfa34f71e24a64dade42ca6e70a7c0435f93b69d96f5e25e9d4a0d8922669d60d1ae42afc387f849f452cb1f3d42a136c64160cf7c3b781d27aefed02245c54227fc838c61568dda0aa7b475452a7c580c488c85226bd9d8c0e1b79\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a14e026003f6a8b98c0844fc61f4145922eef876889e51f30df615937062452e8643bdd95b7594589c2d8c9a3ccb85c908310e44fe12a9a92c14b9064f6bffdac3d238a926f9574897bed2bf039122f6fa8234d2f6a1d3c698fccb59744ba239ee910f5465a4d6f0af47a9233c1cea9251fc01ead8b13b2d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a></p>\n<p>故事放到我身上，是加了料的：<br>\n话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届。<br>\n大娘很快发现我妈是奶奶家这边的话事人，就千方百计讨好以达成间接讨好我妈的目的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/7b9502eabda70d58c99b92a750a7660f6e55ef4a52fe73450ffb1428f2207d4d7628e1af21db8786eb570a3e7a4631c1c24fc2635e551c9da32d3f0bd3fefc936f02aac84db851a4388088dff07927cdd0a22c551677d4514c748c3c9ffe5875f6c489d325b600d4f0ce5fe38e60301a7ffb518233111872\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_025\"></a></p>\n<p>1993年小升初暑假，我照例被寄存在奶奶家。某天，二手堂哥忽然来找我，要我去他家玩。<br>\n他说的“家”是我大娘自己原来的房子，离我大爷大娘那个万人大厂很近，离市区很远。<br>\n我犹豫了3秒就答应了。对我来说最大的吸引力在于，没大人管。二手堂哥那时不喜欢和我大爷住一起，准初二了而且是放假期间，吃饭只需要直接进厂去找我大娘。他是一个人住的。<br>\n此外他们家不光有厂内的闭路电视看，还承诺了要请我打电游。<br>\n他请我打的正是《忍者神龟3》。他们厂子那一带穷乡僻壤，电游厅（包机房）单价也便宜，1块钱40分钟。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b54b5ac10214dfe48e43f3f2859f1e0d64acc617dbca1e2a1135724d182fd4e7f5d9719e636ad56081b37cb78069803a0595254ae02dce5a082f0cde3aebe05574bc58e7d6a50b4dfb30d8ebf02e08b598f7b73ed6387096406bd91f0671a19d12be3f9d934db624e6857cbc748887da8f89cdf639a3fbe6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_005\"></a></p>\n<p>防盗版机制令游戏难度直接变成HARD，敌人都变得皮糙血厚。他花第3块钱的时候我们才见到斯雷德。等我俩打了十几分钟斯雷德还打不死的时候，老板提示说时间要到了，并且友善提醒：这个斯雷德是打不死的，别白费力气了。<br>\n这时旁边有位观战的大哥忽然冒出一句：“只有打斯雷德之前一个馅饼（回血道具）都不吃才能把他打死。”<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8112d1908bbb4d8cf4683f56b043d21c70515aca0c8283d4420bd3274a8c5b127a428913d6858c440e044f28746b0577c6ac8b4ef30138f027f156871be34b179d1d0ce0859e8ec65efdbd8be5f5fd176789b21e3f8bd4b18b52a958302b28710bb04646105889b215ad449d18f0bad6624759dd785acef0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_030\"></a></p>\n<p>第二天回家之后我妈因为我跟“外人”走了把我臭骂一顿。并且要求我找机会请二手堂哥玩点什么，不能占他便宜。<br>\n1993年的中秋节是9月30号。中秋节自己家聚会，第二天有远房亲戚来看望我奶奶。于是第二天的时候就拉他回请，继续玩《忍者神龟3》。<br>\n我奶奶家附近的包机房是正常的1块钱30分钟，但好运气，是30条命的hack版。这次花了4块钱。小心翼翼的不碰馅饼，结果涛声依旧。<br>\n不吃披萨也不能打死BOSS这件事让我直接龙场悟道：“爱科学，传谣不信谣。”<br>\n这也是为什么后来我在电游厅为什么能顺嘴说出“<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/29856bd6e4a7574ac62a47ed9eaee532056658f930e2e0264624964ea10dfe7a013b89334d5a1f5adeae1db57a58c94d26199f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">黑暗海豹</a>”去忽悠别人。既然吃了亏，就要拉更多的人进坑。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d5dda701deb2dad3a3f3562057dfb0fd9140f7cb87364100bc9ef0d995d03ac5b00d00a3c51c1bada000d450b90c79ec002d6c58ba79f7cfc7a746330461ed5a6bb23f3161bb37e32f77b1264f86971156725c7af336b6192cc2defc0fbe3d900a45853a9d876809800bf3d9b876484135831744766a6e2d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_013\"></a></p>\n<p>要说当年就真的没有通关的方法了吗？倒也未必。除了有可能出现的正版卡以外，也有传闻，使用“魂斗罗30条命秘技”是可以选关的，把斯雷德跳过去不就行了。我和二手堂哥也都各自实验了一下，都没成功就放弃了。现在得知真相：《忍者神龟3代》美版选关秘技是<strong>↑↑↓↓←→←→AB</strong>，而我是熟练精准掌握魂斗罗秘技的，只按BA完事，二手堂哥是冗余派的BABA，我们都没按错，也不属于另外一个ABBA的错误派别，所以就一步之遥咯。<br>\n小马过河是世界上最好的寓言，只不过验证这件事，是要付出成本的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8ca7f3c431273f431efce1a1b500db3e0cce425861e96faa70d65046370b81fcfac979fd18aa22138d70355fc52ed67dee939928c18bc93c12009af9edb7bf9320a80edb9f9fa08b480ab396b53f79555a9e47fee80bdef7ef0b0502485f2e20b981230de9341fc33fe46ce8ac4e43dcb2b477948fd5755e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_018\"></a></p>\n<p>说回游戏。本作日版发行于1991年，美版是1992年，FC发展到此时已经是大成阶段，所以这款游戏在画质音乐都非常优秀，游戏性和趣味性比前作更是强出一大截。最大的特色是设计了不同的“绝招”代替之前的“扇脸蛋子”。最好用的依旧是达芬奇，双刀可以封线且多打BOSS几次；其次是多纳泰罗（爱因斯坦），翻滚攻击多段输出；拉斐尔的绝招类似街霸里警察的“窜电”，出招快，连打带跑，安全性高；米开朗基罗的绝招最差，出招慢且主要对空，适用范围极逼仄。<br>\n发这种大招是要掉血的，不过扣到最后一滴血就不会再扣了。由此也诞生了动作游戏小白最普遍的玩法：只要不停放大招就好。这种玩法有两个缺点，一是被碰一下就挂了；另一个是，因为绝招并不是两个键无脑同时按下，而是要先点一下跳在几帧之内再按拳，所以非常累手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/83f06a85b47f97e4073418558fc58ca4fe60f5950b3e47a6c2b213783e0c114b0b525c85b6535ec64428decea09af92ab0a32ae872b08c4c39184a8e010f539a22c5b43670db515e670a94b4ac466dcc6278d88424f66078419f37dbae4bf49ddce9434b0990eee65bc49d035a4d482a39d99a1bc3d16031\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_007\"></a></p>\n<p>高端的玩家玩法要优雅很多，他们用的是另一个新出的招式“下挑”，一般的福特兵一下一个。这招也非常累手，这回累的是左手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4c162fdfc4d9c8ecd8198f48a28fbaba166ba30ed9e3ba59e648c0067b10df03058830856ab64496e0dfbb42dd130eec36614daa9af8f5bb07c29ed73ee20af30feec9c3890b666d3e0223c23fe91f9df2ea75ed0e10cc86ded2b3aefacdab24aa650d58b88f1ca74646b14eb87df95d8d15a869836b9dfe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_006\"></a></p>\n<p>科纳米这次把福特兵的种类设计得异常丰富，长枪、铁桶、鞭子、铁砧、回旋镖，甚至还有专门扬沙子的。尤其倒数第二关有个电梯场景，所有敌人拉出来遛一圈，挺带感的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/989d7ace68c6e3b8d95585f074aef9547252fa6bd8810ae5d0aa06bec6dc4f8468928a858b1c72203343da5b49207859b66e43d4658d70c375b96bac6f4d2c9b31392acae2cd66c464d0d30496bfa5dd7f2600540c402c18d292c8ace1f68e2be6e3eeb9bc4f1ea8c0e6b3c17cb805ae967110048ef04f9e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_032\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/dec5666e05d087f9f3ceb369c7f11f58dd8ed5d95d491303976e2ca164684f51a7eb82f5a1127e8ff87a522cea9eacdb91b0ce91b7161b4046969b14793d9a8bdd7d11653ac4ed1396d068d40fdcb7ef19793f55fb8894af0f71ac47619d2a8350247651c9fa9e06247c9dff01f0820cddb839462e58411a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b5e67de15e88480ff91f84297dbc180c7defb72f87c1da7008d51056e9cc88f6af07b748f44bf849ab27f5197912ba06c7a6dcb4415b73a327f572c7331d6fa1e3cd3fdd40ea48b2b76f60d50b032bfd13b231a34fa5e9cf76b780ca5f7a7f1db392c76a3e4d94ac2cd3484b080971ae5acd056da98aa8bf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_020\"></a></p>\n<p>与之对应的，乌龟的受伤方式也很丰富，被压扁被束缚被电击，统计这玩意儿多少有点受虐狂了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5066a890c85503f79fc2ce201083394ba815ac46cc01bc7e2d1004741209e5f4fe996c4839ad9f70ba64ac98c91603363fadcfb256ca15e8e11e20f94eaeda0de92fcbc9e8019159d21c761b8f773a04e9ce6c08ebf63e4289af47ade1c9483d60da74dc44daa2a6bbef516d5e5c5252f9c9aea62708f053\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b123febaee43a8f1a639228dbea1d487dfe756b488c034552375d98c213ba22a82231e22f7d657d129bb2dbbfa6028d17e95bfd3b16119c80be6902e05cd5f87df9a820af743ceafda2d7d8600806c4cff5846a08aec635d840a7ffc7767558046f52bd32d3258d04e6cd8340df9c0c496df79d4cd12ff72\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_031\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/da425de027c5ea1f8203997c9aa661d00e3494c94b45dc0571a0d0bdd29f91c7cd1c2c6a5dc4c9c6c58bb94b376499bb54c73bc96582c767cc8a4d913a10fce3daba3487a60b0f7507ba8350d1376f06d6c9d8039fe89dfc44d5d1480d716963262999f8b0a88e079a28cab22dd127f44689f7d178251b46\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/bc7bde72d48d810c5205a8b6fa74e0c20b6d35a2b172aa3aeb6ec19c5239456fbc8c03f869d6cea2c6fec1f0d1b53734d446dc2c8d7a2a21f207a19c592d78a22e6792228388e78018564f9b621ef844765de670c347c73b95c9ffb982976363bfc42f1cacb02a72580f5596e35a6eea11ee546af79c6336\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_019\"></a></p>\n<p>故事方面好像是原创的，但也有说法是基于一个动画版改的，不管怎样都平平无奇。反正爱普莉儿又双叒叕被斯雷德抓走了。这次斯雷德和朗格玩了个大的，把整个曼哈顿搞成了个空岛，有种X-MEN电影的既视感。这也是副标题《曼哈顿计划》的由来。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f951736d5e455f7a0abac1429ece4cddfe431c8f35be1376e280b2569525d818eb8edbe044c4b5fb99498b3e65de3dcf9e54fed97ee18850f4354d508845431d4f72a66a0a62c03e76df1e7c339da88a7463910f54cc385673359cc2e508dd01a4ca3621ddc6e50d4d549452697bda5052dd94d931b5e76d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_002\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/7286734fdb05a4c730344d863072fb32a528c7d600dde2a138f7f266d68063b8dfe044e7f5c7f5344e10531d24e0b42bae2b14c34c20554b56f3b418b79b002812d567bbd06a46dfb642cd046a8a519d7192820afed4f555fc07126dbcaddfe733734aa7ab9dde9c625f0ebecc5a95c7fdc2a453b7b57630\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/858dd026cbc291c9f700c4651170fe9c3ee037b639ebca2d218caca45f80570d6e5bff513fac3552e9ceb1aac60405b6dd173d049dfbc9268dd35f802227ca3af28a49cd4c590fbd5daad73054d613132bced3cdefaaa5863876ef9689a007d1731c72c60f95fa5bbb29c0ed65a142f66c7e62ccbc675d1c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_040\"></a></p>\n<p>前面几关BOSS除了牛头猪面这俩熟人，还有很多机械怪和变异怪，不少关卡还设置了些不咬人膈应人的中BOSS，不求要命命但求费血那种。其中见到斯雷德之前最难的是第五关的鳄鱼，甩尾巴那一下又快又狠。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e9dc92e08f46b61f320b3aa614e3e1b4dc1ab1be8c57a13b02a59dca32219f429c2012f3535785f2609765fe818b95e7fb5d5d49230cc19782e58d7ae12b7e2ec841dc6c29812350e56cf2e0e7755a1424ce4ba007f7877dbfc21d25ea20235a7188d258bb5b01a03aa109a62e20bf09e9c72ad74aa11561\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_004\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/dc58fdefbea23c0d0d45eb36927d0108dcfa727af8cd5ad3778686447cd76036d5f2f88197b6f4a1b63a7074292d33def6ff3a970951fb118d58ceaea58015f651f439f9b68c226444e7d3c72be9f59f4ef9d7be115d76927d12d4ee9ee561cfe4721abfd580a59ec7784b8fdbc9834f124067fdc3e1183f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_008\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a2efb5f41e8b4f5153724cfe6e6b82a1679a950b4e6f79cfb878b6b60a6e2a5cbbb38cc392f8b035611653b6245428e16052cd074958839f3b8818323742e269c7fd85392274d2042bd92124ad536f67f25db7bbf7537761605384edd24e2a66c58622ec1e95365e196712775e9a0fc4d6364ed7fb3c5f39\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3ec656eb9d597b48140c7ec885aa97a9ea929d34bec8c6b1b53228132860e300ff239f0eb78dc57b50e6a5096b72d220329ee26caa90114a7a0d737bcf63a8eb259a71220012882d4941a8be1fb643a763483ac167d00b1beaee7b95926e9420c8a60183cc395e0803293c5b81e99ec49167359b157685c9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_015\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/34c122debffd77623845d2708eaec3675dee2509def150b0dec4b6045d6175aa2b6007c6cf4073c7986045b919bf4ffd797247f3c42ff68fe4c8b81188c6850c66feb0b5b10efac062f77548d026485903234fc8c21f77ac500bc3eb445fbbc26afcd8927c37f19590ab58eb29223b1c8c2f89e683cee41d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_021\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/873d656549b631df9b494f970496044d6480cd663fc93130cabf79a0714ae1f530906c053d74b32b6d2db24a90458c8b3762188eec3a27976dfbf5997cc649f139a2286708d8bc510641ecedfa18797336a4eb7e97614ee9e73cee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_024\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/612eedd1fc12fd6f8df9a561d05539fbb8fdb6554756b65d6312b72d6e492b05fec7ea6dfaebd0e92bf65fc82471dbc432f102d18c38675407f46474bd97faf761ccf1382b90d7a45da0ff68e668977a6bf599ebcabdc98e219661cf326a02ef9b42750dddcaf9bdd933304849cca0e7bb9db9dad6e57522\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_026\"></a></p>\n<p>下面就是打不死的斯雷德了。其实正常打不怎么难，压迫感甚至还没有上一代强。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/77716406866bff6f27d2f9b3cec0ed8643165483ef7717d2a3ee63e65e6c4f4f625c2f423beb717866d113a15e3cd1859ffcc1ad4a2c54c7b8068ef97c786729a15234719e66fc861847d1bacf62d4c15dff2d8040d5e422acd35ca24376006017cf927a61086a7223b93a9e26e7c3cf4570da85e564aeae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_027\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f4eb90898fdf0e1528a2c1bca5f341cb7b84b43909a5226efd82d3645b9157f5d73436970dcc7473964d55aea0cc7fa7897a7c8ed6cb4fafba9c5a3beb9ac93892cf2f81bcf8b8ea43cbbd46eaefaee6767e2b73ae28e5f14de30f9da09d76437d3311ff4996dccf4c09900c985521081c11b0e5fa0f9d3d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_028\"></a></p>\n<p>打完斯雷德之后还有还有两关，守关的是朗格和变异斯雷德。难倒是没多难，只是流程相当的长，打到这会儿注意力都下降了，手更是要搓出腱鞘炎了。以我这臭手当年5块钱都不一定能兜住底。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/9a327ee9f24e5c47575429f68ab270ef53531bf034e3166ad73231f6564432650b8c13a3b6431d1a3548888b3d59e075c13c614c9ecf88133a4c72dcbf1979f7dd60de37cc20db534104864f79121ca5c10af6496d8c3c4c4c0b953ac3d6b4bec885b9bb3e40f1229b0891abb75d6298c95241599caff2b3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_029\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e4d4b51c8422995f3f15f23d3308bfcf11a36ea4417fc93516c4c8a631d05220f8eebed273c24720e481a6e12a0d81eced89ce86a35fedbbd469b555563bc5d59fee43f884aad34045466739d86de1f631b55d280d59b68b2f473f0f2214c20a3293c7031974866b1c306af7889104fc1fbe87c2e1beecd1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_034\"></a></p>\n<p>守关的斯雷德，形象莫名有点像《幽游白书》里的武威，技能是操控雷电，不过他放雷电大招的时候也是破绽最大的时候，抓机会一顿猛放大招就行。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5ad8e9b0fea34159dd9492d10039d4f78c7a4ef28b07fbbc3d8020f7b9b0d0642d5480f8a227d305a8cbfc229495900e316e3dff3e53981767b7b2503fc666ed06babb24ddbd65d47113ae2175e8e561b3b8a1a658965d7ce64c87960ef092ddde60ea1ff79c9edad9cf26e72d99848c7c368a65bd1feb92\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_037\"></a></p>\n<p>通关！<br>\n怨念退散！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/53bba28462bca56c6a3b0dae3e234e360fcd2c5092914943783d57d33629ca952b113d1bb6afd372e259fb46f6a112847781b491eb23b88739af9ecb78c590c965ba78817be2ea8f476ee55a9b7f69bfde0f0d21a4a6bd9f95ac073a69e2a6eff09a7a6c1659a671148ab8bed6e97fc7ac6ff4226262fa60\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_038\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-iii-the-manhattan-project.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[47%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2009/05/e7bb9d-e68b9b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">绝招</a><span>[43%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2006/07/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">激龟忍者传</a><span>[42%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2007/07/altered-beast.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">兽王记</a><span>[34%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2015/12/night-night.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">天天天黑</a><span>[33%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
